flowchart LR
  S[Local Python / TS / JS source] --> H[Safe reads + source hashes]
  H --> G[Immutable generation\nfull rebuild on change]
  G --> T[tree-sitter literal chunks]
  T --> F[SQLite / FTS5 + syntax relations]
  Q[Authored query] --> R[Lexical + symbol + heuristic syntax ranking]
  F --> R
  R --> P[Check literal provenance\nomit exact duplicates within packet\nfit complete JSON byte budget]
  P --> O[JSON packet / optional metadata receipt]
  S --> V[Verify selected files + spans]
  O --> V
  O -. not implemented or evaluated .-> A[Downstream agent / consumer]
  V --> B[Match now OR reject stale source]
